    "Learn\n\n# Build your confidence as you build your portfolio\n\nExplore our how-to guides and trading tutorials. Stay current with financial markets and new investment trends.\n\n## [Investing 101](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing-101.html)\n\nNew to investing? Not sure what to buy? This course is for you.\n\n## [Trading with Investor's Edge](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/trading-with-investors-edge.html)\n\nLearn the ins and outs of our trading platform.\n\n## [How to trade options](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/options-trading-course.html)\n\nOptions made simple — covering the basics and advanced strategies.\n\n## Knowledge is your most valuable asset\n\nSelect a topic to learn more\n\n[Stocks](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/stocks.html)\n\n[ETFs and mutual funds](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/etfs-and-mutual-funds.html)\n\n[Fixed income](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/fixed-income.html)\n\n[Options](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/options.html)\n\n[Portfolio strategies](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/portfolio-strategies.html)\n\n[Structured Notes](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/structured-notes.html)\n\n[Accounts](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/accounts.html)\n\n## Check out our latest articles and videos\n\n### What is an ETF?\n\nHow ETFs work and why many investors use them.\n\n[Read article (3 minutes) What is an ETF.](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/etfs-and-mutual-funds/what-is-an-etf.html)\n\n### What is a Canadian Depositary Receipt (CDR)?\n\nCDRs provide exposure to global companies trading in Canadian dollars on a Canadian stock exchange.\n\n[Read article (7 minutes) What is a Canadian Depositary Receipt (CDR)?](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/stocks/what-is-canadian-depositary-receipt.html)\n\n## Looking for more advice?\n\n### Get Jamie Golombek's tax savings tips\n\nTax planning can be an important strategy to help you achieve your financial goals. Explore articles that can help make tax planning easy to understand, relevant and actionable.\n\n[Check out our tax tips](https://www.cibc.com/en/personal-banking/smart-advice/tax-savings-tips.html)\n\n### New to Canada? Here’s how to start investing\n\nIt’s easy to start investing as a newcomer. Learn the basics so you can begin building your financial future in your new home.\n\n[Learn more](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing-basics-when-new-to-canada.html)\n\n## Ready to get started with Investor's Edge?\n\nIt's fast, secure and easy.\n\n[Open an account Opens a new window.](https://m.onlinebrokerage.cibc.com/dco/#/accountOpenPreLogin/en)",
