  "/en/learn/investing.html":
    "[LEARN](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn.html)\n\n# Investment insights\n\nLearn about different investments and strategies to build a strong portfolio.\n\n## Stocks\n\nLearn about stocks, one of the most common investments. When you invest in a stock, you own part of a company and can share in its success.\n\n[Read more about stocks](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/stocks.html)\n\n## ETFs and mutual funds\n\nLearn about exchange traded funds (ETFs) and mutual funds — two easy ways to invest and diversify your portfolio.\n\n[Read more about ETFs and mutual funds](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/etfs-and-mutual-funds.html)\n\n## Options\n\nExplore a variety of topics on options or [check out the course for guided lessons](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/options-trading-course.html) .\n\n[Read more about options](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/options.html)\n\n## Fixed income\n\nDiversify your portfolio with fixed income, which can provide predictable cash flows over time.\n\n[Read more about fixed income](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/fixed-income.html)\n\n## Portfolio strategies\n\nLearn about the different approaches to investing.\n\n[Read more about portfolio strategies](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/portfolio-strategies.html)\n\n## Structured notes\n\nInterested in gaining exposure to the markets, but fear the potential risks that come along with it? Learn about structured notes.\n\n[Read more about structured notes](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/structured-notes.html)\n\n## Accounts\n\nNot sure which account is right for you? Learn more here.\n\n[Read more about accounts](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/accounts.html)\n\n## Knowledge is your most valuable asset. Keep learning with Investor's Edge.\n\n[Investing 101](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing-101.html)\n\n[How to trade options](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/options-trading-course.html)\n\n[Trading with Investor's Edge](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/trading-with-investors-edge.html)\n\n## Ready to get started with Investor's Edge?\n\nIt's fast, secure and easy.\n\n[Open an account Opens a new window.](https://m.onlinebrokerage.cibc.com/dco/#/accountOpenPreLogin/en)",
