    "[Learn](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn.html)\n\nStructured notes\n\n# Structured notes\n\nLearn about structured notes, which are linked to a wide variety of asset classes and can provide an opportunity to create a well-diversified portfolio.\n\n**Latest items**\n\nShowing\nof\n\nitems\n\n### Learn how to diversify with structured notes\n\nInterested in gaining exposure to the markets, but fear the potential risks that come along with it? Learn about structured notes.\n\n[Go to video (4 minutes)](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/structured-notes/ways-to-diversify.html)\n\n## Knowledge is your most valuable asset\n\nExplore more topics\n\n[Stocks](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/stocks.html)\n\n[ETFs and mutual funds](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/etfs-and-mutual-funds.html)\n\n[Fixed income](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/fixed-income.html)\n\n[Options](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/options.html)\n\n[Portfolio strategies](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/portfolio-strategies.html)\n\n[Accounts](https://www.investorsedge.cibc.com/en/learn/investing/accounts.html)",
